  "evidence": [
    {
      "evidence_id": "E01",
      "material_id": "p-16.png",
      "locator": "page 16 image, Figure 12",
      "quote": "The following are learned strategies that teach you how to effectively utilize memory fragments.",
      "support_explanation": "测试回答将学习后的策略作为独立上下文，输入问题和检索事实，不含正确答案；非权重留存对象是指导文本。",
      "kind": "author_report",
      "material_hash": "d330a19f0a2a13ac02c277ef385efb7cda2530a799b098cdd5b384172e836dcd"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "E02",
      "material_id": "p-17.png",
      "locator": "page 17 image, Figure 13",
      "quote": "Your goal is to summarize the reasoning trajectory and identify the key factors that led to a correct or incorrect answer.",
      "support_explanation": "反思器可见问题、真值、回答与正确性等级，从执行结果产生诊断；这不意味着部署时可以获得真值。",
      "kind": "author_report",
      "material_hash": "c90218ab0e0221bff17c3768f016d5a751306bbe2692cdf27867983e8c912d0f"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "E03",
      "material_id": "p-18.png",
      "locator": "page 18 image, Figure 14",
      "quote": "Compare the successful vs unsuccessful attempts",
      "support_explanation": "每题采样5个回答并用真值判别后比较，生成 add/update/delete；同页要求经验通用、非领域事实、单句至多30词。未说明采样全对或全错时的特殊策略。",
      "kind": "author_report",
      "material_hash": "9a277e08ce3a0d6eaa99ecff3ba38e7f2c3571f242f04a5b4447b765b3cf7675"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "E04",
      "material_id": "p-19.png",
      "locator": "page 19 image, Figure 15",
      "quote": "Your task is to consolidate these proposals, resolve conflicts, and produce the final update plan.",
      "support_explanation": "批次过滤器整合提案、去重、解决矛盾并输出最终增改删，之后执行写回；是语义质量过滤，不是逐候选独立效果验证。",
      "kind": "author_report",
      "material_hash": "49fca50345710d22701a8d8d1b5ece83cc76d455d4537edd7b26f45bfa20acc8"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "E05",
      "material_id": "p-19.png",
      "locator": "page 19 image, Figure 15",
      "quote": "Don't delete meta-memories unless they are clearly wrong or completely redundant",
      "support_explanation": "已有条目有保守删除及优先更新的规则；未给可执行的效用阈值、硬容量、版本回滚或性能下降时自动拒收方案。",
      "kind": "author_report",
      "material_hash": "49fca50345710d22701a8d8d1b5ece83cc76d455d4537edd7b26f45bfa20acc8"
    },
    {
