      "material_id": "text",
      "locator": "Appendix A.5, lines 2369–2375",
      "quote": "For each fold, a subset of 100 samples is reserved as the independent test set, while the remaining data is partitioned into 350 samples for meta-memory training and 50 samples for validation.",
      "support_explanation": "五折、seed42，训练/验证/测试分开；主文400构建/100测试由附录细化。支持未参与构建的问题上评价，未证明会话/实体级无交叠。",
      "kind": "author_report",
      "material_hash": "f6875b2278483f1b96cca76f21cb0acad2af4e63fbd0760b6a0ee3ec67400f53"
